.TH ANUBIS\-ROBOTS2POLICY 1 2026-10-01 "anubis 1.27.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
anubis\-robots2policy \- convert a robots.txt into an Anubis policy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B anubis\-robots2policy
.RI [ options ]
.B \-input
.I robots.txt
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a robots.txt (a file, or \- for standard input) and writes
the equivalent Anubis bot rules, in YAML by default.
.B anubis\-robots2policy \-help
lists every option.
.TP
.BI \-input " file|\-"
The robots.txt to convert.
.TP
.BI \-output " file|\-"
Where to write the rules (default standard output).
.TP
.BI \-action " ALLOW|DENY|CHALLENGE|WEIGH"
Action for disallowed paths (default CHALLENGE).
.TP
.BI \-format " yaml|json"
Output format.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR anubis (1)
